
# CCNA — Week 1 Documentation

## 📚 Week 1: Networking Fundamentals & Cisco Basics

This repository documents my Week 1 CCNA study and hands-on lab work. The focus of this week was building a foundation in computer networking, understanding Ethernet and network devices, learning how data moves through a network, and performing basic Cisco IOS configuration.

---

